obsidian-git (Vinzent03/obsidian-git), MIT License
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

https://github.com/Vinzent03/obsidian-git

Git sync (src/modules/sync) follows obsidian-git's behaviour, studied at
NAMEWTA/obsidian-git-zh commit bde2d06edf2cac28f90cba796afc51bdbf73f160 (branch
wta): commit modes (src/main.ts resolveCommitMode), the commit-and-sync order,
the serial operation queue (src/promiseQueue.ts), automatic routines
(src/automaticsManager.ts) and conflict blocks (src/editor/conflicts). The
conflict block parser and commit modes are adapted from it; the rest is written
for NAND.

